 "11", "value": "dim"}, {"type": "texture", "measure": "11", "value": "independent lines"}, {"type": "texture", "measure": "12", "value": "homophonic"}, {"type": "texture", "measure": "13", "value": "melody + accompaniment"}, {"type": "dynamic", "measure": "15", "value": "cresc"}, {"type": "key", "measure": "10", "value": "Db major"}]}, {"start_measure": "16", "end_measure": "19", "headline": "A new key and sudden accents", "text": "The estimated key moves to Ab major [m. 16]. This is a modulation, a change of key. The marking rfz is a sudden strong accent, and it appears in [m. 17-19]. The parts mostly move in chords.", "focus_part": "all", "claims": [{"type": "modulation", "measure": "16", "value": "Ab major"}, {"type": "key", "measure": "16", "value": "Ab major"}, {"type": "texture", "measure": "16", "value": "homophonic"}, {"type": "dynamic", "measure": "17", "value": "rfz"}, {"type": "texture", "measure": "18", "value": "homophonic"}]}, {"start_measure": "20", "end_measure": "22", "headline": "Closing the first part", "text": "Violin 1 probably leads again in [m. 20-21]. The lines become more independent [m. 21-22]. Swelling and fading are both marked here. The estimated key stays Ab major.", "focus_part": "Violin 1", "claims": [{"type": "lead", "measure": "20", "value": "Vn1"}, {"type": "texture", "measure": "21", "value": "independent lines"}, {"type": "dynamic", "measure": "20", "value": "cresc"}, {"type": "dynamic", "measure": "20", "value": "dim"}, {"type": "key", "measure": "20", "value": "Ab major"}]}, {"start_measure": "23", "end_measure": "27", "headline": "Slower and hushed: the middle section", "text": "The tempo marking changes to Più lento, which means slower [m. 23]. The dynamic drops to pp, very soft. The parts move in chords. Violin 1 leads. The estimated key turns to G# minor [m. 24-27], which is darker.", "focus_part": "Violin 1", "claims": [{"type": "section", "measure": "23", "value": "Section 2 (Più lento)"}, {"type": "dynamic", "measure": 