iment"}, {"type": "dynamic", "measure": "2", "value": "p"}, {"type": "dynamic", "measure": "2", "value": "cresc"}]}, {"start_measure": "7", "end_measure": "12", "headline": "声部交织，力度时起时伏", "text": "这一段主奏不明确，第一小提琴与中提琴可能共享旋律 [m. 7-9]。[m. 9] 和 [m. 11] 各声部线条更独立。谱上有渐强和渐弱记号，所以力度有逐渐的变化，但整体基本仍在弱的范围内。", "focus_part": "all", "claims": [{"type": "lead", "measure": "7", "value": "Violin 1"}, {"type": "texture", "measure": "9", "value": "independent lines"}, {"type": "texture", "measure": "11", "value": "independent lines"}, {"type": "dynamic", "measure": "11", "value": "dim"}, {"type": "texture", "measure": "12", "value": "homophonic"}]}, {"start_measure": "13", "end_measure": "15", "headline": "仍在降D大调，渐强收束", "text": "第一小提琴可能继续领唱，其他声部伴奏 [m. 13-15]。[m. 15] 有渐强记号。调性仍为降D大调。", "focus_part": "Violin 1", "claims": [{"type": "key", "measure": "13", "value": "Db major"}, {"type": "texture", "measure": "13", "value": "melody + accompaniment"}, {"type": "dynamic", "measure": "15", "value": "cresc"}]}, {"start_measure": "16", "end_measure": "22", "headline": "转到降A大调，重音点缀", "text": "从 [m. 16] 起进入降A大调。[m. 17-19] 出现 rfz，意思是突然加重的一下重音。[m. 18] 是主调织体，即一个声部带旋律，其余声部节奏同步。[m. 21-22] 则变为各声部线条独立。", "focus_part": "Violin 1", "claims": [{"type": "modulation", "measure": "16", "value": "Ab major"}, {"type": "dynamic", "measure": "17", "value": "rfz"}, {"type": "texture", "measure": "18", "value": "homophonic"}, {"type": "texture", "measure": "21", "value": "independent lines"}]}, {"start_measure": "23", "end_measure": "23", "headline": "更慢、更弱：中段开始", "text": "[m. 23] 进入 Più lento（更慢）。力度降到很弱（pp）。各声部同步行进，是主调织体。", "focus_part": "Violin 1", "claims": [{"type": "section", "measure": "23", "value": "Section 2 (Più lento)"}, {"type": "dynamic", "measure": "23", "value": "pp"}, {"type": "texture", "measure": "23", "value": "homophonic"}]}, {"start_measure": "24", "end_measure": "27", "headline": "转入升G小调，色彩变暗", "text": "[m. 24-27] 估计转入升G小调，色彩偏暗。各声部大体同步行进，第一小提琴带着旋律。[m. 25] 为很弱（pp），其间有渐强记号。", "focus_part": "Violin 1"